The output clearly shows you're using Rook-Ceph managed by ODF, not cephadm. That's why these commands fail:

ceph orch device ls
ceph orch host ls

ceph orch is only available with cephadm, not with Rook.

The important issue is still:

✅ MONs are running

✅ MGR is running

✅ MDS is running

❌ No OSD pods

❌ 0 OSDs in the cluster


Since there are no rook-ceph-osd-* pods, ODF never created any OSDs.

Next step: Verify why ODF didn't create OSDs

